/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: credentialless

/login
  ! Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy
  ! Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy

# Same reason as /login: these pages open a wallet, and COOP would cut
# window.opener on the cross-origin hop (Meteor reports "User closed the
# window"). It is why payment lives on its own page rather than in the app.
/pay.html
  ! Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy
  ! Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy

/x402-test.html
  ! Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy
  ! Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy
